{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02216",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.91,
      "end_seconds": 5.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Erm, um, good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.63,
      "end_seconds": 11.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.47,
      "end_seconds": 19.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor. I look after them so I thought I'd come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.28,
      "end_seconds": 25.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "I wanted to get constant worrying looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.72,
      "end_seconds": 28.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.76,
      "end_seconds": 32.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Probably about a week. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.46,
      "end_seconds": 36.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.27,
      "end_seconds": 44.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.53,
      "end_seconds": 51.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.65,
      "end_seconds": 53.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Mostly mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.75,
      "end_seconds": 59.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "What about a tight chest, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.49,
      "end_seconds": 67.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Yes, actually. Ah, I've been feeling on edge too, for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.92,
      "end_seconds": 72.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.72,
      "end_seconds": 87.04,
      "duration_seconds": 14.32,
      "text": "I'd call it severe. Ah, as for trouble sleeping, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.87,
      "end_seconds": 92.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Did you notice any chest pain on exertion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.14,
      "end_seconds": 98.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any chest pain on exertion."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.11,
      "end_seconds": 104.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "And what about thoughts of harming myself, drinking more or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.11,
      "end_seconds": 113.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "I haven't had thoughts of harming myself, drinking more or weight loss, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.21,
      "end_seconds": 119.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.43,
      "end_seconds": 126.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.02,
      "end_seconds": 131.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Okay, what operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.39,
      "end_seconds": 136.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.09,
      "end_seconds": 141.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.63,
      "end_seconds": 155.6,
      "duration_seconds": 12.97,
      "text": "An irregular heartbeat, for about a year. An underactive thyroid, for five years. Let me think, I've had epilepsy for about ten years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.43,
      "end_seconds": 159.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.77,
      "end_seconds": 163.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Ah, my aunt has rheumatoid arthritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.31,
      "end_seconds": 168.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.51,
      "end_seconds": 182.89,
      "duration_seconds": 13.38,
      "text": "Bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, once a day. It's Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid. I'm on carbamazepine, 200 milligrams, twice a day for the seizures."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.79,
      "end_seconds": 200.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.58,
      "end_seconds": 210.27,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day. Nothing, I'm teetotal. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.09,
      "end_seconds": 216.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.62,
      "end_seconds": 228.61,
      "duration_seconds": 9.99,
      "text": "I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 230.52,
      "end_seconds": 239.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.01,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Saturation 98 percent, pulse 85. Blood pressure 110 over 71, temp 37.0 degrees, respiratory rate 17."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.04,
      "end_seconds": 240.74,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.19,
      "end_seconds": 246.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.95,
      "end_seconds": 249.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Right, look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.23,
      "end_seconds": 274.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "Your heart sounds are normal and your thyroid feels normal in size."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.67,
      "end_seconds": 293.46,
      "duration_seconds": 13.79,
      "text": "You can sit up now. From what you've told me and what I found, the most likely explanation is generalised anxiety. I'd also keep an overactive thyroid in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.95,
      "end_seconds": 336.02,
      "duration_seconds": 26.07,
      "text": "I'll request a thyroid test, it'll help with anxiety symptoms. The treatment will be sertraline, 50 milligrams, once a day, long term. That's for anxiety. Try slow breathing and regular exercise, and limit caffeine. The talking therapy service would be the right next step, I'll refer you. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.1,
      "end_seconds": 338.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Yes, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.11,
      "end_seconds": 342.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.69,
      "end_seconds": 347.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.61,
      "end_seconds": 349.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}